) -> dict[str, dict[str, Any]]:
    """Completion records already effective at moment ``at``.

    A completion whose moment is not earlier than or equal to the
    evaluation moment still lies in the future of the snapshot and keeps
    occupying capacity as if it did not exist.
    """
    return {record["job_id"]: record for record in records.values()
            if record["at"] <= at}


